ふるってご応募ください。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1342/923/1.png","blocks":null,"ts":1628283600,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/present/1342923.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/present/1342923.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sumi","count":5,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UFHQ7TNT0","U01J7703PFT","UKN1S3W31","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3zc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aefb628a-77a2-4458-b42f-c9d80f0a9a81","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"宅内LANが2.5G以上になるとNASもSSD化したくなり上流も2.5G以上にしたくなってくるので :spin_keizai_x2: チャンス","ts":"1628323967.060500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spin_keizai","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q9dc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32E05C2B-2338-4C7E-95AD-4E98FAA3CC30","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"一般人にとって宅内LANは1Gbpsが上限というのが長い間の常識だったわけですけど、それが変わるかもしれないのは歴史的な変化だと思った。\nネットワーク構成も原理的には大丈夫だと知りつつ、やったことないからいざやろうとすると不安になる。これは良くない。\n早くガジェットを買って、経験を積んで成長しなければ。\n注：100Mbpsもギリ経験しているけど、そのときは、家にネットワークを作るほどマシンがなかったし、HDD I/Oの限界があった。","ts":"1628322265.058900","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1628324549.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zYOf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1addca96-ad8b-4b76-8866-f88ae2557a93","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"~2.5G導入しても5年もすれば10GbEの波が一般家庭にも来てると思うのでここは思い切って40G対応スイッチを~","ts":"1628320117.054400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U06ECBRTJ","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQysw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98813DE4-F750-4940-876B-F0F5570A325C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/shimizu/1334862.html|https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/shimizu/1334862.html\u003e\n具体的にはこいつを導入しようか検討中です","ts":"1628320012.052800","attachments":[{"fallback":"INTERNET Watch: ついに2.5Gbpsスイッチが税込1万円以下！　熱対策も万全なプラネックス「FX2G-05EM」【イニシャルB】","id":1,"title":"ついに2.5Gbpsスイッチが税込1万円以下！　熱対策も万全なプラネックス「FX2G-05EM」【イニシャルB】","title_link":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/shimizu/1334862.html","text":"　2.5Gbps LAN市場に大きな衝撃が走りそうだ。プラネックスから登場した5ポートの2.5Gbps対応スイッチ「FX2G-05EM」は、税込価格が1万円以下と、コスパの高さで有名な海外メーカーをも圧倒する低価格を実現した製品となっている。徹底した熱対策も施されており、むしろコストがかかっているのではないかと思わせる充実度だ。その詳細に迫ってみた。","image_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/img/iw/list/1334/862/001.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1625432400,"service_name":"INTERNET Watch","service_icon":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/shimizu/1334862.html","original_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/shimizu/1334862.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kgj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0990135B-CE05-4246-B59A-E2134DC9C180","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"定期的に湧き上がる宅内LANを改善したい欲がきて構成を考えています。","ts":"1628319775.051700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EFAa1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4953fa4-149d-452f-ab49-0a915ab7ce9f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"L3で解決しなければいけない部分がないので大丈夫かと","ts":"1628319585.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ok_hand","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ndb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c917351e-e114-4803-b502-b816d2641749","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ちょっと加筆しました。経由しなければ大丈夫ですよね。","ts":"1628319309.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"b